tsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gjbmwlYUImb2lQBp5LV3KA","review_id":"wPGiqUctp0WLZwKDfOWV0w","date":"2017-11-13T18:13:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9597377777099609,"text_excerpt":"I don't even know where to start. Maypop has been on my list for a while, so when I saw that I would be in the area, I made plans with a coworker to get lunch here. My entire experiences here was nothing short of amazing. We got here a bit after typical lunch hour around 1 or so, and the place was pretty much empty which is always fine by me. We were seated and our drink orders were taken. After looking over the menu and deciding what we wanted, we settled on the fried oyster app and I got the pork belly, grillades and cheesy grits as my entree. After we ordered, someone from the kitchen brought out a complimentary sample of the curry beignets. These little beignets were delicious and pac..."},{"business_id":"gjbmwlYUImb2lQBp5LV3KA","review_id":"nYxqzYBGmmdbThEEArkoEw","date":"2018-01-19T04:00:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9478007555007935,"text_excerpt":"We went to the amazing Maypop tonight! The ambience is aesthetically pleasing with beautiful lighting and a calm, serene atmosphere. Our server was very attentive and gave excellent recommendations. We started with the Bibb lettuce appetizer which had a delicious green tomato relish. My husband had the capellini pasta with chick peas and I had a seafood dish with clams, and jumbo shrimp with a delicious saffron curry sauce. Everything was seasoned perfectly and the Asian Indian spices were like nothing we have ever had. I also had a Mekong Collins with a grapefruit flavor that was so good. We finished with the Maypop Pie that had a gingersnap crust and meringue topping which was SO good! ..."},{"business_id":"gjbmwlYUImb2lQBp5LV3KA","review_id":"qWRFtkiIgXWqk_d-ZoTKNQ","date":"2017-09-26T22:16:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9453992247581482,"text_excerpt":"My hubs and I had dinner at Maypop with a couple of friends this week and enjoyed our time. The service was spot on. The wait staff was helpful, EXTREMELY knowledgeable about every menu item, super attentive and very hip. We enjoyed some tasty cocktails - and our server was spot on when it came to helping us choose a bottle of wine that would satisfy all of our tastes. We also ordered a couple of appetizers. We had the Crispy Fried P & J Oysters, and they were stellar. The oysters were perfectly fried and the sauce was amazing. I can't forget the manchego on top - It is one of my favorite cheeses. I had the sweetbreads as my entrée, and they were delicious! My husband had a crab and smoke..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gjbmwlYUImb2lQBp5LV3KA","photo_id":"RL0HPlLyn0P9epUb9Xg4Sw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RL0HPlLyn0P9epUb9Xg4Sw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8836527466773987},{"business_id":"gjbmwlYUImb2lQBp5LV3KA","photo_id":"nf0mrPyn9r1oL3Ba7pZTbw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nf0mrPyn9r1oL3Ba7pZTbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.878544807434082},{"business_id":"gjbmwlYUImb2lQBp5LV3KA","photo_id":"_Dln_QvVIRp0pRyA6LnBkw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_Dln_QvVIRp0pRyA6LnBkw.jpg","visual_represe